"During our MPLS backbone migration to dual-stack operation, we're encountering challenges with BGP route distribution between Nokia 7750 SR routers running VPNv4 services. What's the proper configuration approach to ensure VPNv4 prefixes are correctly propagated across IPv6 transport links while maintaining an IPv6 next-hop address for these routes? We need this to work without disrupting existing IPv4-based customer VRFs during the transition period."

