To resolve BGP-labeled IPv4 route next-hop issues using static routes without affecting default routes, implement the following configuration:

```
/configure router policy-options
begin
prefix-list "BGP_NH_STATICS"
    prefix 192.0.2.0/24 exact
    prefix 203.0.113.0/24 exact
    # Add additional required prefixes here
exit
policy-statement "BGP_NH_POLICY"
    entry 10
        from
            prefix-list "BGP_NH_STATICS"
            protocol static
        action accept
    exit
    default-action reject
exit
commit
```

```
/configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            allow-static
        exit
        policy "BGP_NH_POLICY"
    exit
