This configuration implements the requested BGP backoff sequence:
- `idle-hold-time 10` = Initial 10-minute hold period after first failure  
- `idle-hold-time 15` = Subsequent failures trigger 15-minute holds (doubles exponentially to 30/60/120)  
- `idle-hold-time 120` = Maximum cap of 120 minutes (2 hours)  
- `error-interval 45` = Requires 45 minutes of stable operation to reset the penalty counter  

The sequence progression will be:  
10m → 15m → 30m → 60m → 120m → (resets after 45m stability)
