- Replace `<GROUP_NAME>` and `<NEIGHBOR_IPV6_ADDRESS>` with your BGP group name and neighbor IPv6 address.  
- Apply this configuration to all relevant BGP peers involved in the IPv6-labeled MPLS transport.  
- Verify with `show router bgp neighbor <IP> advertised-routes label-ipv6` to confirm multiple paths are advertised.  

