To configure BGP graceful restart helper support for IPv6 prefixes on your Nokia 7750 SR and maintain IPv6 traffic during neighbor reboots, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        graceful-restart
            restart-time 300
            enable-notification
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` enables helper functionality for all supported address families, including IPv6.  
- `restart-time 300` sets the maximum time neighbors have to restart (default is 120 seconds at global BGP level).  
- `enable-notification` allows graceful recovery if peers send NOTIFICATION messages.  

