To address the BGP path selection issue for MVPN IPv6 NLRIs on your Nokia 7750 SR routers, configure the following to bypass router ID checks while preserving other best-path criteria:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        best-path-selection
            ignore-router-id include-internal mvpn-ipv6
        exit
    exit
```

**Key details:**
- The `ignore-router-id` command skips router ID comparisons for the specified family (`mvpn-ipv6`), resolving the strict path selection issue.
- Regular unicast routing remains unaffected as this modification applies exclusively to MVPN IPv6 NLRIs.
- Other best-path attributes (e.g., LOCAL_PREF, AS_PATH length) continue to operate normally, maintaining path selection integrity.

