To achieve optimal propagation of multiple path alternatives for unlabeled IPv4 prefixes and support multipath negotiation, configure the following on your Nokia 7750 SR:

```cli
configure router bgp
   backup-path ipv4
   group "UPSTREAM"
      add-paths
