To ensure BGP failover aligns with BFD for subsecond convergence on Nokia 7750 SR routers, configure BFD directly on the BGP peer interface to bind the BGP session state to BFD viability. Use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group <EDGE_GROUP>
        neighbor <NEIGHBOR_IP>
            bfd-enable
```

