   ```cli
   configure router interface <INTERFACE_NAME>
       bfd 100 receive 100 multiplier 3
   ```
   Adjust `100` (milliseconds) and `3` (multiplier) to meet your subsecond requirements.

This setup ensures traffic failover occurs as soon as BFD detects a path failure, synchronizing BGP with the physical/logical link state.
