To address unresolved next-hops for BGP-labeled IPv6 routes on Nokia 7750 SR route reflectors using LDP tunneling in inter-AS scenarios, apply this configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            rr-use-route-table
        exit
        shortcut-tunn
            family ipv6
                resolution-filter ldp
        exit
    exit
