To implement extended BGP graceful restart for maintenance windows on a Nokia 7750 SR router, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
   graceful-restart
      restart-time 600
      enable-notification
   exit
   damp-peer-oscillations
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` enables BGP graceful restart helper functionality.  
- `restart-time 600` extends the restart timer to 600 seconds (default is 300), allowing peers to preserve forwarding state longer during control plane upgrades.  
- `enable-notification` ensures session stability if NOTIFICATION messages are exchanged during maintenance.  
- `damp-peer-oscillations` (with default parameters) prevents rapid session resets post-maintenance by suppressing peer oscillations.  

**Note:** Adjust `restart-time` as needed based on your maintenance window duration. Ensure peers also support graceful restart for this to take effect.
