To implement selective AS-path sanitization for BGP updates on the Nokia 7750 SR, configure the `remove-private` command with the `skip-peer-as` option. This ensures private AS numbers are stripped from outbound updates per RFC 7454, except when AS64512 is present in the peer's AS path. Apply this at the global BGP level:

